        "product_summary": "Open-heel mule construction: A closed toe is combined with a fully open back, allowing the foot to slide into the knitted upper.\n\nPatterned knit upper: Larger visible knit openings across the forefoot contrast with denser sections around the side and entry edge.\n\nSculpted EVA outsole: Angled grooves and a raised sidewall give the sole its distinctive profile, visible in the actual side and bottom photographs.\n\nFive colour directions: White/Green, Red/Black, Purple/Black, Coffee and All Black pair the knitted upper with matching or contrasting sole colours.\n\nWholesale assortments: This backless closed-toe style is listed in EU35-46 for colour-size mixes.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
